_exptl_special_details           
;

The experimental observation is that there are
few high-angle data and the diffraction was
limited to a theta max 41.04. We propose that
this could be due to the highly porous nature
of this compound solvent included in the
pores was highly disordered causing a high
background which washed out high
angle data.

;



